    "heading": "Level 3: Potent Cantrip",
    "lineStart": 4751,
    "lineEnd": 4753
  },
  "section": "3.353",
  "rulesText": "Your damaging cantrips affect even creatures that avoid the brunt of the effect. When you cast a can-trip at a creature and you miss with the attack roll or the target succeeds on a saving throw against the cantrip, the target takes half the cantrip's damage (if any) but suffers no additional effect from the cantrip."
}
